{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2017-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1512086400, "end_date": 1512691199, "month_true_total": 903, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:07:43 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "38140881", "author": {"steamid": "76561198262063159", "personaname": "SpongeBilal Sajidpants", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198262063159/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2581, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1381, "last_played": 1589588883, "avatar": "6ce06964d6ce7ac9b562bf5d060e84db97d38c5a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Okay so this game is really good but you also have to have a beast of a pc to run it. This game took optimization and threw it out of a window 50 stories up and ran it over 30 times.\n", "timestamp_created": 1512690819, "timestamp_updated": 1512690819, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51754385232925415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38140537", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001796199", "personaname": "Mashacre", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198001796199/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 83612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 56856, "last_played": 1562596403, "avatar": "fa7a6a3c8f0580f01ba5db07a744412f7bd5d9a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent !", "timestamp_created": 1512689492, "timestamp_updated": 1512689492, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38140363", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207369644", "personaname": "Jonesy220", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SASSYPOTATOSCALLOPS/", "num_games_owned": 29, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11265, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9035, "last_played": 1536984220, "avatar": "ec0f2a6a462ec7098147a9c47195efa743ff5b25"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great Game,\n\nOverall,\n Bohemia Interactives ARMA III is an amazing miliatary simulation, and so much more. From the community Role-Play servers to the Hardcore Tactical game modes, they're truly is something for everyone. I recommend watching tutorials based around movement and vehicle controls first, as it can be a little confusing for a new comer at first. with over 100 Hr's in this game, and many more planned, I honestly can't recommend this game enough.\n\n10/10 Would wreck at altis life again ~ Uncle Bill - Notorious Altis criminal - 2017\n", "timestamp_created": 1512688825, "timestamp_updated": 1512688825, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476833969354629517", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38140189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165117871", "personaname": "Roman1776", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Roman1776/", "num_games_owned": 263, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 36822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4385, "last_played": 1777177500, "avatar": "39d26fd892ec7add3b1cf3a11002ab2642705520"}, "language": "english", "review": "its just fun mates", "timestamp_created": 1512688136, "timestamp_updated": 1512688136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "38140157", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971304076", "personaname": "Rain", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rainman512/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 195641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 175818, "last_played": 1781821477, "avatar": "9c98341f51bd5d6de971147ce8a8181a8e4688d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "After almost 3000 hours of gameplay this is still by far the most fun game to play out there. And I swear by the gods, I still learn something new in Arma 3 almost every day. \n\nThe core community in Arma is likely the most organized gaming community ever in a PC game with tons of units, clans, streamers, gameplay styles, modmakers and events. \n\nWanna pilot choppers or fighter jets? Drive tanks or fancy sports cars? Large scale combined arms battlefields? Roleplay or just some fast paced deathmatch? Coop milsim or hardcore zombie survival? Arma has all of this and tons more. There's something for everyone. This game has freakin armed [url=http://taskforceunicorn.com/]unicorns[/url]in it!\n\nSerious fun and A LOT of bang for the buck. \n\nWould recommend! 11 out of 3 bullet drops.", "timestamp_created": 1512688008, "timestamp_updated": 1524352682, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 70, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.832746207714080811", "comment_count": 5, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}